{"4418420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "OUTBLAST", "steam_appid": 4418420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras/c51f9f56a46103898382a3503da20516.poster.avif?t=1780584603\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras/c51f9f56a46103898382a3503da20516.webm?t=1780584603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras/c51f9f56a46103898382a3503da20516.mp4?t=1780584603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rogue viral intelligence known as <strong>Typhon</strong> is spreading through the system, corrupting entire districts and destabilising the planetary Core. Standard defences have failed. You, the interceptor <strong>C11-28,</strong> have been deployed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your objective:</strong> Destroy infected constructs, collect data particles, and purge the system before total collapse.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and Furious Arcade Gameplay:</strong> Boost, blast and bomb your way through anything that stands in your way in this fast and frantic arcade shooter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 different bosses &amp; districts:</strong> Defend the core of Perseon-6 and its districts from Hydra, Gorgon, Minotaur, Siren and Typhon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Up:</strong> Level up your ship as you blast through threats; collecting data fragments and leaving nothing in one piece.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaderboards:</strong> Compete against friends, enemies and other players in a race to the top on global leaderboards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VR &amp; Flatscreen support : OUTBLAST</strong> has been developed for Virtual Reality and flatscreen platforms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras/db3e2c954f4c23463ca1a4e4f134f449.poster.avif?t=1780584603\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras/db3e2c954f4c23463ca1a4e4f134f449.webm?t=1780584603\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras/db3e2c954f4c23463ca1a4e4f134f449.mp4?t=1780584603\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3991 :</strong> Cerion corp announces the “Perseon” project, a vector city for the 5th millennium, built on the foundations of ceros core technology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3993 :</strong> Cerion corp revolutionises digital technology with the invention of the ceros core.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4013 :</strong> The perseon project releases galaxy wide. Within months, perseon reaches maximum capacity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4020 :</strong> Perseon-6 opens. Over 90% of humanity are now digital citizens of the ceros network.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4022 :</strong> In the darkest corners of the net in the undercity of perseon-2, the <strong>Typhon</strong> virus is born.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras/16facf75d3c2200917f492bf40de4e15.avif?t=1780584603\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras_big/16facf75d3c2200917f492bf40de4e15.webp?t=1780584603 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OUTBLAST</strong> is developed for Virtual Reality and Flat screen, tether your headset and jump into PERSEON-6; sit within the core and defend the against infected constructs. <strong>OUTBLAST</strong> is best played with controller, and VR players will require controllers with analogue sticks, or to use a gamepad for the best experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras/3deeba935105811f199b708e29e10f77.avif?t=1780584603\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras_big/3deeba935105811f199b708e29e10f77.webp?t=1780584603 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full Steam Achievement support featuring 15 unlockable achievements. From defeating corrupted mythic bosses to mastering high-skill challenges such as flawless runs, speed laps, massive kill streaks, and ultimate combo clears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras/243db34551633c7deeff097b9162e600.avif?t=1780584603\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4418420/extras_big/243db34551633c7deeff097b9162e600.webp?t=1780584603 width=1560 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conservation lies at the core of Rhino 